# Phase 10c — Responsive phone/tablet

**Branch:** `phase-10c-responsive`

## Goal

Usable TaskMesh chrome and primary workflows on Pixel 8 Pro (~412×892) and Galaxy Tab S4 / SM-T830 (~800–1030 wide).

## Exit criteria

- Tabs / board tabs scroll horizontally on narrow screens
- Documents / To Do split panes stack ≤800px
- Tables scroll horizontally; backup actions wrap
- ElementShell / ConfirmDialog near full-viewport on phone
- Touch targets ≥~44px for small controls; hover-only dismiss visible on touch
- Command palette / canvas height use `dvh` and tighter phone layout
- Content max fluid (~1100px) for tablets
- QA checklist for Chrome device mode (412 + ~800)

## Non-goals

Nav drawer rewrite, Excalidraw redesign, auth, Phase 10d nginx.
